2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Victor
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince of Carignan
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Christine of Hesse-Rotenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT Detail
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
