1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://gw.geneanet.org/pierfit?lang=en&p=guy+3eme+baronnet&n=campbell Geneanet Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 17 2019, 16:56:52 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lt.-Col. Sir Guy Theophilus Campbell, 3rd Bt. was born on 16 October 1854. He was the son of Colonel Sir Edward Fitzgerald Campbell, 2nd Bt. and Georgiana Charlotte Theophila Metcalfe. He married Nina Lehmann, daughter of Frederic
2 CONC k Lehmann and Nina Chambers, on 30 April 1884. He died on 12 September 1931 at age 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT He fought in the Afghan War between 1878 and 1880. He was Aide-de-Camp to Lieutenant-Governor of Bengal. He succeeded as the 3rd Baronet Campbell, of St. Cross Mede, Hampshire [U.K., 1815] on 23 November 1882. He gained the rank o
2 CONC f Lieutenant-Colonel. He gained the rank of Major in the 60th Rifles.
