1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Photo: on right in John Singer Sargent's portrait of the Wyndham sisters (Lady Elcho, Mrs. Adeane, and Mrs. Tenant), 1899 (Metropolitan Museum)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pamela_Wyndham
2 CONT
2 CONT "Pamela Adelaide Genevieve Wyndham Glenconner Grey (1871-1928), later Lady Glenconner, Viscountess Grey of Fallodon was an English writer. She was the former wife of Edward Tennant, 1st Baron Glenconner, and later of Edward Grey, 
2 CONC 1st Viscount Grey of Fallodon. She is one of the Wyndham sisters by John Singer Sargent and they were at the centre of the cultural and political life of their time. Like their parents, they were part of The Souls."
2 CONT
