1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/104443221/person/250040850383 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 26 2022, 18:55:39 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Guy L. Babcock, 77, of Cortland died yesterday morning at Nineveh.  He is survived by four sons, Daniel of East Sidney, Wallace of Afton, Duane of Detroit, and Guy Babcock, Jr., of Cortland; three daughters, Mrs. Genevia Burns of 
2 CONC Nineveh Junction, Mrs. Harriet Ellis of Springville, Pa., and Mrs. Elizabeth Lewis of East Guilford; one brother, Warren Babcock of Elk Lake, Pa.; one sister, Mrs. Ida O'Brien of Montrose, several grandchildren, great-grandchildre
2 CONC n, and nieces and nephews.  The body was moved to the Osterhoudt Funeral Home, Harpursville, where friends may call today from 7 to 9 p. m.
2 CONT
2 CONT    source: page 29, Binghamton Press, Fri., Oct. 11, 1957* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/70119697/guy-lee-babcock Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 26 2022,
2 CONC  18:56:47 UTC''
