1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00034708&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT Franz Josef Marie Otto Antonius Ignatius Oktavianus Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #43934, b. 22 March 1904, d. 1 January 1981
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=20 Jun 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Franz Josef Marie Otto Antonius Ignatius Oktavianus Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz was born on 22 March 1904 at Prague, Czech Republic. According to Schaffy´s diary (i.e. Bertha Pfeifer, née Groebe) he was born in Upper Villa Groebe
2 CONC  (Villa Grebovka). (1) He was the son of Otto Weriand Hugo Ernst Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz and Elisabeth Marie Erzherzogin von Österreich. (1) He married Countess Ghislaine d'Arschot-Schoenhoven, daughter of Countess Guillaume d'Ars
2 CONC chot-Schoenhoven and Eva Nubar, on 3 January 1934 at Brussels, Belgium. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 1 January 1981 at age 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Franz Josef Marie Otto Antonius Ignatius Oktavianus Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz gained the title of Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Franz Josef Marie Otto Antonius Ignatius Oktavianus Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz and Countess Ghislaine d'Arschot-Schoenhoven
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Stephanie Maria Eva Prinzessin zu Windisch-Grätz+ b. 17 Jan 1939
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Guillaume Franz Josef Maria Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz b. 19 Nov 1950
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás:
2 CONT
