1 NOTE He was last king of Portugal. He succeeded to the throne in 1908 during 
2 CONT the troubled period after the assassination of his father, King Carlos, 
2 CONT and his older brother, Crown Prince Louis. His reign lasted only until 
2 CONT 1910, when a naval revolt caused him to flee, first to Gibraltar and then 
2 CONT to England. Although he never officially abdicated, he made no effort to 
2 CONT regain the throne.
