1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://austria-forum.org/af/AEIOU/Petznek%2C_Elisabeth_Erzherzogin_Elisabeth_Marie
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Marie Erzherzogin von Österreich (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #103544, b. 2 September 1883, d. 22 March 1963
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=28 Jan 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=2.29%
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Marie Erzherzogin von Österreich was born on 2 September 1883 at Laxenburg, Vienna, Austria. (3) She was the daughter of Rudolf Franz Karl Joseph Kronprinz von Österreich and Stéphanie Clothilde de Belgique, Princesse de
2 CONC  Belgique. (1) She married, firstly, Otto Weriand Hugo Ernst Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz, son of Ernst Ferdinand Weriand Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz and Kamilla Prinzessin zu Oettingen-Oettingen und Oettingen-Spielberg, on 23 January 1902
2 CONC  at Vienna, Austria. (3) She and Otto Weriand Hugo Ernst Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz were divorced in 1924. (1) She married, secondly, Leopold Petznek, son of Franz Petznek and Marie Lackmayer, on 4 May 1948 at Vienna, Austria. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 22 March 1963 at age 79 at Vienna-Hütteldorf, Austria. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Marie Erzherzogin von Österreich was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. Elisabeth Marie Erzherzogin von Österreich also went by the nick-name of Erzsi. (3) She was baptised with the name of Elisabeth Marie Henri
2 CONC ette Stephanie Gisela. (3) She gained the title of Erzherzogin von Österreich. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elisabeth Marie Erzherzogin von Österreich and Otto Weriand Hugo Ernst Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz
2 CONT
