1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''From [https://www.freebmd.org.uk/cgi/information.pl?cite=H6T7s4N0i4j7uVrNiAq0wQ&scan=1 FreeBMD - Registration of birth of Felicia Louise M. Stewart in 1890]'''
