1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/104443221/person/250040855110/facts Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 26 2022, 18:55:39 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Born December 10, 1905 in West Windsor, NY.
2 CONT Married September 2, 1932 to Edna Hackett (née Clara Edna Hurlburt) in Coventry, NY.
2 CONT Died January 16, 1959 in Sidney, NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary:
2 CONT WALLACE LEE BABCOCK, 53, of Afton RD1, died at 12:30 p. m. Friday at the Hospital, Sidney after a long illness.  He is survived by his wife, Mrs. Edna Hurlburt Babcock of Afton RD 1; four daughters, Mrs. Clara Diagostino of Syracu
2 CONC se, Miss Mary Babcock of Bainbridge, Mrs. Sharon Church of Endwell, and Miss Lucille Babcock of Afton RD 1; six sons, Wallace Lee Babcock, Jr. of Norwich, Thomas Babock of Binghamton, Everette Babcock of Greene, Dwight, Leo and Ga
2 CONC ry Babcock all of Afton RD 1; two grandchildren; three sisters, Mrs. Genevia Burns of Nineveh, Mrs. Harriet Ellis of Springville, Pa., and Mrs. Mary Elizabeth Lewis of Guilford; three brothers, Daniel Babcock of Sidney Center, Dua
2 CONC ne Babcock of Detroit, Mich., and Guy Babcock, Jr. of Syracuse, and several aunts, uncles, nieces and nephews.  The body was removed to the Karschner Funeral Home, Afton, where friends may call from 7 to 9 p. m. tomorrow.
2 CONT
2 CONT source: page 14, Binghamton Press, Sat., Jan. 17, 1959
