2 CONT Guillaume Franz Josef Maria Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz was born on 19 November 1950. He is the son of Franz Josef Marie Otto Antonius Ignatius Oktavianus Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz and Countess Ghislaine d'Arschot-Schoenhoven.
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillaume Franz Josef Maria Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz gained the title of Prinz zu Windisch-Grätz.
2 CONT
