2 CONT Died: January 8, 2020 (age 83 years), Servicio de Neurología Hospital Ruber Internacional Neurología Clínica Aplicada SLP, Madrid, Spain
2 CONT Spouse: Luis Gómez-Acebo, Duke of Badajoz (m. 1967–1991)
2 CONT Buried: January 28, 2020, Sacramental Cemetery of San Isidro, Madrid, Spain
