1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Princess Maria Pia of Bourbon-Parma=
2 CONT '''Princess Maria Pia of Bourbon-Parma''' (née Princess Maria Pia of Savoy; born 24 September 1934) is the eldest daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Umberto-II-re-d-Italia-King-of-Italy/6000000000632031531?through=30577135808
2 CONC 0006449 Umberto II of Italy] and [http://www.geni.com/people/HRH-Princess-Marie-Jose-of-Belgium/6000000002142087088 Marie-José of Belgium]. She is the older sister of Princess Maria Gabriella of Savoy, the Prince of Naples, and Pr
2 CONC incess Maria Beatrice of Savoy.
