2 CONT * [http://thepeerage.com/p11195.htm#i111948 '''Michael Koloman Erzherzog von Österreich''']
2 CONT * Michael Koloman Erzherzog von Österreich1
2 CONT * born -. 5 May 1942
2 CONT
2 CONT * Michael Koloman Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 5 May 1942 at Budapest, Hungary. 
2 CONT * He is the son of Joseph Franz Erzherzog von Österreich and Anna Monika Pia Prinzessin von Sachsen.
2 CONT * He married Christiana Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rosenberg, daughter of Karl VIII Fürst zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rosenberg and Carolina dei Conti Rignon, on 4 March 1966 at Bronnbach an der Tauber, Germany, in a civil marri
2 CONC age. Michael Koloman and Christiana were also married in a religious ceremony on 14 April 1966.3
2 CONT * He was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich (styled as HI&RH Archduke of Austria).
2 CONT * He was given the name of Michael Koloman Pius Matthias Ludwig Emerich Martin von Habsburg-Lothringen at birth.
2 CONT *  He was a commercial manager.
2 CONT * He lived in 1977 at Walhallastrasse 8, München-Nymbpenburg, Germany.* 
2 CONT * Children of Michael Koloman Erzherzog von Österreich and Christiana Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rosenberg
