1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elisabeth Prinzessin zu Schwarzenberg''' was born on October 1, 1947 in Wien. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34699338596 Heinrich Prinz zu Schwarzenberg, Herzog von Krummau] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-346
2 CONC 99338783 Lori Gräfin zu Stolberg-Stolberg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Regina Maria Gabriela married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34699338926 Rüdiger von Pezold] on May 16, 1970 in Pöls ob Judenburg, Steiermark.. Together they had the following children: 
2 CONT * Anna von Pezold b. 14 May 1971
2 CONT * Heinrich von Pezold b. 1972
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34699338514 Juliane von Pezold]
2 CONT * Philipp von Pezold b. 1975
2 CONT * Felix von Pezold b. 1978
2 CONT * Johann von Pezold b. 1978
2 CONT * Adam von Pezold b. 1982
2 CONT
