2 CONT
2 CONT Her mother is an Italian princess, Donna Olimpia Torlonia di Civitella-Cesi (born 1943), daughter of Don Alessandro Torlonia, 5th Prince di Civitella-Cesi and of Spanish Infanta Beatriz of Spain (daughter of King Alfonso XIII of S
2 CONC pain). Donna Olimpia is also a sister of Don Marco Torlonia, 6th Prince of Civitella-Cesi and a cousin of King Juan Carlos I of Spain as well as the American actress Brooke Shields (a granddaughter of Don Alessandro Torlonia's sis
2 CONC ter Donna Cristina).
2 CONT
