0 @N6000000002322350246@ NOTE Louis-Philippe was the last of the French monarchs. France had gone through
1 CONT the First Republic from 1792-1799 after Louis XVI, into the years of Napoleon
1 CONT Bonaparte as First Council from 1799-1804, into the First Empire under
1 CONT Napoleon I as Emperor from 1804-1814, into the Bourbon Restoration from
1 CONT 1814-1848, into the Second Republic from 1848-1852, into the Second Empire
1 CONT under Emperor Napoleon III from 1852-1870, and finally, into the Third
1 CONT Republic  from 1871 on. Monarchy in France had died on February 24, 1848.
0 @N6000000002176689638@ NOTE Louis-Philippe was the last of the French monarchs. France had gone through
