0 @N6000000002322315687@ NOTE This marriage was arranged by Rudolf's father, but Rudolf was not happy in
1 CONT it, nor was he happy with his political designs, and he fell into despondency.
1 CONT He had fallen in love with the baroness Maria Vetsera, a girl of 17 with whom
1 CONT he had begun relations in October of 1887. On the morning of January 30,
1 CONT 1889, Maria and Rudolf were found shot to death in the hunting lodge at
1 CONT Mayering, culminating a suicide pact together. Aside from mental derangement,
1 CONT the most plausible explanation for the act was a sense of political isolation.
