0 @N6000000002240794819@ NOTE A tractable constitutional monarch, he accepted a Liberal cabinet and readily
1 CONT acquesced in Italy's war against Turkey in 1911 and entrance into World War I
1 CONT in 1915. When the strains of the war brought Mussolini to the fore, Victor
1 CONT Emmanuel failed to prevent the Fascist seizure of power and was quickly
1 CONT reduced to a figurehead or less by the Mussolini dictatorship. But, in 1943,
1 CONT following disastrous Italian military reverses in World War II capped by the
1 CONT Allied invasion of Sicily, Victor arrested & replaced Mussolini as premier.
